      },
      "widgets_values": [
        "可选 session 输入保留导演指令、参考音色与历史；references 未连接时继承会话参考，连接后替换。\nConnect session for direction, voices and history; leave references unconnected to inherit the Session voices.\ngeneration_mode：together 同场生成；per_line 逐句；per_line_context 逐句听前句；per_speaker 按角色生成后还原剧本顺序。\nSelect any of the four generation modes in the scene node.\nsplit_long_text 可用于全部四模式；chunk_bytes 限每次新剧本 UTF-8 字节（含标签/分隔符），历史另受模型上下文限制。同原台词分块间不加静音。\nEnable split_long_text for all modes; chunk_bytes includes new-script tags/separators. No extra gap between chunks of one original line.\n参考转写前加 <|speaker:0|> / <|speaker:1|>；剧本使用相同标签，或让 Anna / Ben 按首次出现顺序映射到 0 / 1。name 只作显示，不绑定音色。\nPrefix reference transcripts with matching speaker:0 / speaker:1 tags. Use the same script tags, or first-seen Anna / Ben mapping to 0 / 1. Reference name is display-only.\n加载器支持 FP8、INT8、W6、W4；可填写 model_path / codec_path 自定义位置。expert_placement 默认 ram；vram 要求完整单卡驻留，显存不足明确拒绝。moe_backend / cuda_graph 记录实际后端与回退。\nChoose your checkpoint and custom paths. expert_placement=ram uses a cache; vram requires full single-GPU residency and rejects insufficient memory. Kernel and Graph fallbacks are recorded separately."
      ],
      "title": "使用说明 / Instructions"
    },
